{
  "title": "pe_serdes — one strobe, end to end (UART TX, 8N1)",
  "subtitle": "The same bit_en pulse drives every stage. Timing numbers from tb_pe_uart.v: 16 clk cycles per bit cell.",
  "output": "strobe-flow.svg",
  "legend": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t0",
      "kind": "start",
      "text": "TB: line = 1 (idle)",
      "row": 0,
      "col": 0,
      "w": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "kind": "start",
      "text": "TB: line = 0 — START bit",
      "row": 1,
      "col": 0,
      "w": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "kind": "process",
      "text": "TB: tx_load = 1, tx_len = 8\n(one clk wide)",
      "row": 2,
      "col": 0,
      "w": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "kind": "decision",
      "text": "tx_load && |tx_len ?",
      "row": 3,
      "col": 0,
      "w": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "t4",
      "kind": "process",
      "text": "snapshot into the DUT:\ntx_shreg, tx_nbits, tx_cnt = 0,\ncfg_lsb_tx (= 1 for UART)",
      "row": 4,
      "col": 0,
      "w": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "t5",
      "kind": "side",
      "text": "tx_busy ← 1",
      "row": 5,
      "col": 0,
      "w": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "kind": "process",
      "text": "bit_en pulse — THE STROBE\n(first one 16 clk after load)",
      "row": 6,
      "col": 0,
      "w": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "t7",
      "kind": "decision",
      "text": "tx_cnt == tx_nbits - 1 ?",
      "row": 7,
      "col": 0,
      "w": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "t9",
      "kind": "end",
      "text": "8th strobe: tx_busy ← 0,\ntx_done ← 1 (one-cycle pulse)",
      "row": 9,
      "col": 0,
      "w": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "t8",
      "kind": "side",
      "text": "tx_cnt ← tx_cnt + 1:\nthe next bit appears on tx_ser",
      "row": 8,
      "col": 1,
      "w": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "m2",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "tx_ser is COMBINATIONAL — it reads tx_shreg through tx_rd_idx, so the bit is already correct BEFORE the strobe arrives.",
      "row": 4,
      "col": 1,
      "w": 250
    },
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "THE COMMITTING EDGE = the clk edge where bit_en is high. Nothing in this DUT changes without one.",
      "row": 6,
      "col": 1,
      "w": 250
    },
    {
      "id": "m3",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "The strobe supplies the TIMING; the DUT only counts. Spacing (16 clk here) is the timing block's job, not this block's.",
      "row": 9,
      "col": 1,
      "w": 250
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "t0",
      "to": "t1"
    },
    {
      "from": "t1",
      "to": "t2"
    },
    {
      "from": "t2",
      "to": "t3"
    },
    {
      "from": "t3",
      "to": "t4",
      "label": "yes"
    },
    {
      "from": "t4",
      "to": "t5"
    },
    {
      "from": "t5",
      "to": "t6"
    },
    {
      "from": "t6",
      "to": "t7"
    },
    {
      "from": "t7",
      "to": "t9",
      "label": "yes — last bit"
    },
    {
      "from": "t7",
      "to": "t8",
      "label": "no — more bits"
    },
    {
      "from": "t8",
      "to": "t6",
      "label": "wait 16 clk, strobe again",
      "route": "loop-left"
    },
    {
      "from": "m1",
      "to": "t6"
    },
    {
      "from": "m2",
      "to": "t4"
    },
